---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content'; import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro'; import Header from '../../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro'; import FormattedDate from '../../components/FormattedDate.astro';
const posts=(await getCollection('blog',({data})=>!data.draft)).sort((a,b)=>b.data.pubDate.valueOf()-a.data.pubDate.valueOf()); const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');
---
<html lang="ko"><head><BaseHead title="Notes | BACKSPACE.DATA" description="데이터 분석 기록"/></head><body><Header/><main><header><h1>Notes</h1><p>분석 도구의 사용법부터 프로젝트에서 발견한 패턴과 판단 과정까지 기록합니다.</p></header><section>{posts.map((post,i)=><article><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div class="meta"><time><FormattedDate date={post.data.pubDate}/></time><small>{post.data.tags.join(' · ')}</small></div><a href={`${base}/blog/${post.id}/`}><h2>{post.data.title}</h2><p>{post.data.description}</p></a><a href={`${base}/blog/${post.id}/`}>↗</a></article>)}</section></main><Footer/></body></html>
<style>header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:330px;padding:60px 0 90px}header p{align-self:center;max-width:430px;font-size:1.2rem}section{border-top:1px solid #111}article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 170px 1fr 25px;gap:20px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #111}article>span,time,small{font-size:.65rem}.meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.meta small{color:#666;text-transform:uppercase}article a{text-decoration:none}article h2{font-size:1.75rem;margin:0 0 10px}article p{color:#555;max-width:620px;margin:0}@media(max-width:700px){header{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto;gap:35px}article{grid-template-columns:30px 1fr 20px}.meta{grid-column:2}article>a:nth-of-type(1){grid-column:2}}</style>
